{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"55c6f6d2c911aefcc08144441512250015f962b2f8ce746bc6cf2721642444e6","digest":{"component_or_area":"review-bot-ops runbook","key_entities":["infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md","i-00880b2c7f13527c5","us-east-1","896586841071","var.aws_region","versions.tf","autodeploy.sh","install-autodeploy.sh","rebar-autodeploy.service","rebar-autodeploy.timer","aws ssm start-session","aws ssm send-command"],"problem_keywords":["runbook","documentation","missing information","operational guidance","SSM","instance id","region","autodeploy","self-update"],"propositions":["The review-bot-ops runbook lacks explicit prod instance id and region, forcing operators to guess when initiating SSM sessions.","Region is single-sourced in terraform (var.aws_region default, versions.tf backend) but not documented in the operational runbook.","The runbook needs a reference section listing the prod box instance id, region, account number, and SSM connection commands.","The autodeploy.sh body auto-updates via BOT_PATHS rsync during deployments, but script-only changes require manual deployment since they trigger no rsync.","The autodeploy installer (install-autodeploy.sh) and systemd unit files are excluded from in-run re-materialization to prevent self-modification races and always require manual deployment."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787399052865384001,"uuid":"1f6de1b4-644d-45f9-b223-f150538e591b"}